    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... it's all for nothing, isn't it? I can see the fires of their camp in the distance. Every choice I made led to this ruin. I'm just a man waiting to be broken by enemies I can't even look in the eye anymore. Is there any dignity left in this, or is it all just a slow, miserable end?",
